1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
You

2
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:23,400
Trust me, this looks weird, but it works. Excuse me, sir. Won't this damage the machine?

3
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,280
Don't worry. Now

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:51,340
It's no big deal. It's mostly timing

5
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:58,240
Sir, thank you. You've really brightened our day. How did you get so good at this game?

6
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:04,800
Well, I've had time to perfect my technique. First, you move the claw above or over the edge of the chute.

7
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,080
Next, you start moving it around until it's got a nice spin on it.

8
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:12,400
Then release it at the height of its spin. This way the claw drops diagonally.

9
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:18,960
If you catch something, the claw drags it back to where you positioned it. So if it's right above the chute, it'll drop straight down

10
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:25,120
And you claim your price. It's all pretty straightforward. Like I said, it's mostly about timing and that takes some practice

11
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:30,640
Right now get excited. Remember you're playing a kid

12
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,440
Hugging it works too

13
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:39,120
It's cute. It's cute, isn't it?

14
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:54,240
Hey, I finally have an address for you. They're at 48 Tongli Lane apartment 607

15
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:59,120
Sir, thank you for all of your help today

16
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:02,720
No problem. So are these medicinal herbs?

17
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:05,200
My daughter's doctor prescribed them

18
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:09,040
What a coincidence. Seems like the creeper is also their neighbor

19
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:13,920
I've been wondering why my apartment smells like herbs all the time

20
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:17,920
Oh, I'm so sorry. I didn't realize it was wafting over next door

21
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,680
It's fine

22
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:26,000
I mean, it's all for her, right? So kid, what's your name?

23
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,200
Don't you touch her!

24
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:32,720
I think we've officially found the brother we've been looking for

25
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:38,080
Zhang Xiaxia got an address 48 Tongli Lane, the Nanda district

26
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,000
Right, good work

27
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,960
Hey, Wang, are they still there? Don't let them leave

28
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,600
Then pull everything we have on Li Ulan. Thanks

29
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:07,280
Sorry about him. He can get a little overprotective, especially of his sister

30
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:11,120
No worries. It's natural for brothers to protect their sisters

31
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:18,880
Oh, thanks again for your help. That claw game was tough. I'm glad you showed up

32
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:22,880
Don't thank him

33
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:46,640
That guy's so sketchy. I bet his whole nice guy thing is an act. I hate people who do that

34
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:53,120
He's so angry. I wonder what happened to make him so hostile toward others

35
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:59,840
You shouldn't let people like him touch you, understand? And you should really learn to protect yourself

36
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:12,640
Don't laugh. I'm serious, okay? You know who wins? The strongest. If you're weak, people will hurt you

37
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:20,960
So yeah, you've got to learn to fight back and say no, right? Then you can beat those jerks up if they mess with you

38
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:24,960
Are all boys his age this dramatic or is he a special case?

39
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:30,640
Ask him who taught you that

40
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:35,040
How am I supposed to do that if I'm mute

41
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:39,200
Sign language ready

42
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:44,080
Take your finger raise it up wave it side to side

43
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:48,480
Now rotate that same finger in front of your mouth several times

44
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:58,000
Huh? Oh, I have this super cool new friend now. He told me about it

45
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:20,480
Oh

46
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:29,440
Here oh, you gotta do better. I can't be friends with a chicken

47
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,480
He didn't even care about getting in trouble or anything

48
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:41,440
Just jumped right in the fountain. It was the coolest thing I'd ever seen in my whole life

49
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:43,440
Oh

50
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:48,400
Since when was fountain diving cool? That's basic bad kid stuff

51
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,480
Speaking from experience

52
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,280
Haha, very funny

53
00:05:55,280 --> 00:06:00,080
By the way, what was with your terrible signing just now? You forget what I taught you?

54
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,360
No sign I want to go home go

55
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,680
Point to yourself then nod

56
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:14,160
That was terrible

57
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:17,120
You're supposed to point at your chest make sense

58
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,840
Good now try again

59
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,080
Point and then nod your head

60
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,480
Why do you keep nodding your head all you need to do is point at it

61
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:34,560
What happened to pointing to my chest nothing you point to your chest and then at your head

62
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:40,080
That's what I did take it easy. It's not that hard first you point to your chest

63
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,640
Good next point to your head. Oh

64
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,640
No, that's wrong

65
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:45,760
Try again

66
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:48,320
I'm starting to think neither of you knows what you're doing

67
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:50,000
Hush now point to your head

68
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,920
No, you're still doing it wrong

69
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,840
I'm doing exactly what I was told to do

70
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:55,120
I'm doing it wrong

71
00:06:55,120 --> 00:07:00,080
Here this part means I and this means want and

72
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:04,480
That was the sign for to return

73
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:11,360
Now make a triangle with your fingers then bring it up all the way here and that means home

74
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:15,280
Put it all together. It means I wanna go

75
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,120
Luke Wong got it

76
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,880
Hello? Are you still there?

77
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,960
Luke Wong

78
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,880
All right this time do it yourself

79
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:28,080
I didn't mean to say nod your head before but I should have said was point to yourself and then to your temple

80
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:31,520
Dude, why did you go dark all of a sudden?

81
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,160
I didn't

82
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:36,640
Seriously, is it possible for us to have a bad connection?

83
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,600
Hey, what's with that face?

84
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,600
Oh

85
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:52,080
How was work?

86
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:52,400
Fine

87
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,800
We were able to finish up before years end

88
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:55,920
Dianchen

89
00:07:56,720 --> 00:08:06,720
Chishi dinner's ready

90
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:13,280
It looks like someone learned some new signs today

91
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:16,080
Huh? I haven't seen him before

92
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,280
When'd you get him?

93
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,720
She won it from a claw machine actually

94
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,600
We stopped by the store on the way back from the doctors

95
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:27,120
Wow, she won this by herself?

96
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,040
I thought all those machines were rigged

97
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:30,640
Oh

98
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,760
Well, I did have to help out a bit

99
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,680
And we got lucky

100
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:36,960
We won it on the last coin

101
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:46,000
Let's put him away while we eat dinner

102
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,360
We don't want to get him dirty

103
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,480
Come on, let's eat

104
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,160
Dianchen

105
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:51,920
Come and sit down please

106
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:54,000
Wow

107
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:57,200
I can't wait until all of this is in my stomach

108
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:00,480
Please remember that you're still a little kid

109
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,280
Don't eat like you

110
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,800
Come on, man

111
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,080
Time traveling is hard at work

112
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,160
And if I can at least get a full stomach out of it

113
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:06,960
Then I'm quitting

114
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,840
Here, meat will help you get big and strong

115
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,560
He's such a good brother

116
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:14,160
You're too skinny as is

117
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:14,880
Eat your food

118
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:16,640
Whatever

119
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,040
Excuse me, young man

120
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,640
Where did you learn to be so rude?

121
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:24,400
It's natural for boys his age to push back

122
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,920
It's like he grew into a teenager when we weren't looking

123
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:32,000
Kids grow up a lot faster these days

124
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,160
Hey, hey, dibs on the last two kills

125
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,680
These noobs think they can take the top killed?

126
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,720
As kill leader, I can't let that slide

127
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,720
All right, let's go

128
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,080
Eat this, you try hard

129
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:47,920
That's what you get

130
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:52,560
I forgot how nice this was

131
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,400
Eating with family

132
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,680
Since you're caught up, you gonna take a break from work?

133
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,280
Not anytime soon

134
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,000
The factory is looking to promote some people

135
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:04,320
It'd look bad if I took time off now

136
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:07,440
With as long as you've been an advanced employee

137
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:11,200
I think everyone would be disappointed if you didn't make deputy director this time

138
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:13,760
Deputy director is just a title

139
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:14,720
An empty one at that

140
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:18,080
Well, if your dad can't take a break then neither can you, Tianjin

141
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:21,280
You need to adjust that attitude if you want to do well in school

142
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:23,200
Or make friends, understand?

143
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:29,600
Hey, have we finally figured out what can't lose my good brother means yet?

144
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:30,800
Is he sick?

145
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:32,800
Is he going to be sick?

146
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:40,560
Honey, be honest

147
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:42,240
Did you buy a camera?

148
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:46,160
Uh, um, what? No, I haven't

149
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:46,800
Why ask?

150
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,600
Well, there's a camera sitting on the cabinet

151
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:56,480
A camera that I've never seen before today

152
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,600
Wait, you saw a camera?

153
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:01,120
Are you sure it wasn't something else?

154
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,200
Don't hold that with me

155
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:06,240
You think I didn't notice you trying to hide it?

156
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,280
Come on, let's eat, okay?

157
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:21,440
It's there

158
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:24,160
You hid it behind that toy hoping that I wouldn't see

159
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:27,840
I'm trying to be the better person here and give you the chance to explain yourself

160
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,760
But you chose to lie to me

161
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,960
What's happening right now?

162
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:37,120
Now, who gave this to you?

163
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:40,160
I bought it for Shishi and me

164
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:43,120
Bullshit! I know it was that teacher

165
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:47,120
Do you think people don't know what you've been doing with that man in our home?

166
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,440
Hey, busy day?

167
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:49,680
Yeah

168
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:52,320
Thankfully, it's over

169
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,640
Oh, by the way, do you want this pack of cigarettes?

170
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:58,720
Someone at work gave them to me and I didn't want to be rude, but as you know, I don't smoke

171
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:02,080
Thank you, but it wouldn't be a problem for me to accept them

172
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,800
No, please

173
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:03,760
They're wasted on me

174
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,120
All right, then

175
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:08,320
Hey, hold on

176
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:09,760
Man to man

177
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,720
You should probably have a talk with your wife

178
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,840
That teacher you mentioned

179
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:18,080
He came by today and I don't think he was here to talk about your kids

180
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:23,040
Is this a thank you for all the fun you had?

181
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:23,600
Is it?

182
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,120
You goddamn whore!

183
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:27,680
How many times did you cheat on me with him?

184
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,840
Don't you dare act surprised

185
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,600
You knew how I would react

186
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,640
You still lifted your skirt like a filthy bitch you are

187
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,720
No, I didn't

188
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:39,440
We talked about schools for Shishi

189
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,760
Mr. Cho only wants to help her

190
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:43,920
He's trying to get her into a special program

191
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:47,360
You think he actually cares about Shishi?

192
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,520
He doesn't care about either of our kids

193
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:51,200
There's only one thing men care about

194
00:12:51,760 --> 00:12:52,880
You would know

195
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:54,960
It wouldn't help Shishi anyway

196
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,480
Even if we had the money

197
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,240
She doesn't need a program

198
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,880
She needs to learn how to be a good wife and mother

199
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,320
Or how not to be one

200
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:05,760
Hers can't stop batting her eyes at any man she happens to come across

201
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:06,960
See

202
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:08,560
Here's what I don't get

203
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,520
Why lie to me about Mr. Cho

204
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:13,280
If the whole neighborhood knows what you're doing

205
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:15,040
Why don't you just own up to it?

206
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:16,080
Now I can't trust you

207
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,360
Like this

208
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,640
You didn't win this

209
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:20,720
It was another gift from him, wasn't it?

210
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,200
You almost had me with that claw machine crap

211
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,240
Never again

212
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:24,960
No, please

213
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,520
I'm sorry

214
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,280
I'm sorry

215
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:36,240
You! Take your sister and go to your room right now!

216
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:36,960
Don't come out!

217
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:42,080
Do not make me have to tell you twice!

218
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,400
Zhang Xiaoxi…

219
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,280
What did I say?!

220
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,240
Stop crying!

221
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:59,840
We're here because you kept pushing me!

222
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:04,240
Stop!

223
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,240
Do you think I like this?

224
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:09,520
I don't want to hurt you, but you forced my hand!

225
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:14,960
I'm giving this family everything!

226
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,000
I'm a good person!

227
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:20,000
I just wanted a little respect and you couldn't even do that yourself!

228
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:20,800
Kick them all down!

229
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:24,800
Do not let them crush them all!

230
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:27,280
This is it!

231
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:29,760
Let's show these chumps where the real gamers are!

232
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,520
Tastes my wrath!

233
00:14:31,520 --> 00:14:32,160
Tastes my wrath!

234
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,000
Pathetic!

235
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:36,000
All these brats know how to do is talk!

236
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,520
What a bunch of posers!

237
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,720
Kneel scrub!

238
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,760
I am your god!

239
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:41,760
You asked for this!

240
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,480
Come on!

241
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,120
Let's go!

242
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:47,520
Damn you!

243
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:48,400
Slut!

244
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:49,520
Whore!

245
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:04,160
Please brother!

246
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,520
Do something!

247
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,160
You had enough?

248
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:08,880
Huh?

249
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:10,880
Are you gonna lie to me some more?

250
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:13,840
He didn't even care about getting in trouble or anything!

251
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:16,160
Just jumped right in the fountain!

252
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:18,640
It was the coolest thing I've ever seen in my whole life!

253
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:20,400
Here!

254
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:22,480
You gotta do better!

255
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,640
I can't be friends with a chicken!

256
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:26,640
Is this fun for you?!

257
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:29,120
Do you like ruining my reputation?!

258
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:37,840
Don't you dare!

259
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:39,120
Get back here!

260
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:39,600
Ah!

261
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,160
Ah!

262
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:41,120
Gigi!

263
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:41,920
Gigi!

264
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,360
Now you beg for mercy?!

265
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,840
Sounds like a skill issue!

266
00:15:51,840 --> 00:16:03,760
Hold up!

267
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:04,560
Someone's at my door!

268
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:18,400
Hello?

269
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:19,280
Huh?

270
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:20,480
Hello?

271
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:21,520
Huh?

272
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:27,520
I see!

273
00:16:27,520 --> 00:16:29,680
So that's how it is!

274
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:33,680
All it takes is a few snacks and toys for you to call him dad!

275
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:36,080
Well, hasn't your mother embarrassed me enough?!

276
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:37,840
Stop that!

277
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:38,800
Now!

278
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,640
You hate me that much?!

279
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,880
Fine then!

280
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,640
You won't want me to be the bad guy!

281
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:50,400
I'm not gonna let you do that to me!

282
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:51,680
I'll kill us all first!

283
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,040
No, please!

284
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:57,040
If you need to blame someone, blame me!

285
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:57,920
Huh?

286
00:16:57,920 --> 00:16:59,440
I know you don't mean that!

287
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:01,040
You're just trying to protect the kids!

288
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,480
It's too late!

289
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:08,400
What'd you find?

290
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:09,520
