291
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:11,440
Liu Lan was murdered seven years ago.

292
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:13,360
What happened?

293
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:17,840
The report says she was found dead along with her husband, Li Fan.

294
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,200
Hold on.

295
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,400
Her husband's dead too?

296
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:28,160
Who's there?

297
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,320
Uh, just me.

298
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:34,960
So, I'm in 606.

299
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:37,280
Did you happen to see who was knocking on my door?

300
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:38,400
You're mistaken.

301
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:39,600
We didn't hear any knocking.

302
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,480
Uh, everything good?

303
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,440
We found a mouse.

304
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:46,960
Haven't got him yet.

305
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,880
Hammer's been giving me trouble.

306
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:52,800
It can't tell what it's hitting, so perhaps you should mind your own business.

307
00:17:52,800 --> 00:18:02,720
Well, please keep it down, or I'll have to call the cops.

308
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:10,240
I told you his nice guy thing was just an act.

309
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:16,320
It's just one thing after another.

310
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:18,880
So what was that?

311
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,400
Did you seduce the neighbor too?

312
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:22,480
Is that why he wanted to play hero?

313
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:26,080
Is there no man he won't let have a turn with you?

314
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:28,080
I'm picking for help for divorce.

315
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:30,320
You can remarry.

316
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:30,560
No.

317
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:33,280
Why should you get what you want?

318
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:33,600
Huh?

319
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:34,880
Why you?

320
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:37,040
You make me a punchline!

321
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:52,240
I'll die before I let you take anything else from me!

322
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,440
Your house forія came to me!

323
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:58,640
Without Resì, I bet you can keep turning points!

324
00:18:58,880 --> 00:19:00,160
There was nothing else from ruin place at school.

325
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:01,120
What's that?

326
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:02,320
What...

327
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:10,560
You're not talking about security for faults.

328
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:11,440
That's why I did.

329
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,120
Don't say security for us.

330
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:24,900
All right, you got me.

331
00:19:25,900 --> 00:19:27,160
Can I at least know your name?

332
00:19:27,540 --> 00:19:27,900
Sure.

333
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,460
It's Li Tenxie.

